'''Lando Calrissian's farm''' was a plot of land owned by the [[The galaxy|galactic]] entrepreneur [[Landonis Balthazar Calrissian|Lando Calrissian]] on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[planet]] of [[Lothal]]. However, it was in reality a front for an illegal [[mining]] operation.<ref name="IA" /> When Calrissian was absent, his [[RQ protocol droid]] [[W1-LE]] maintained the [[farm]]land.<ref name="RB">{{InsiderCite|158|Rebel Bluff}}</ref> Calrissian purchased the farm from the [[Devaronian]] [[crime lord]] [[Cikatro Vizago]].<ref name="IA" /> It was close enough to the [[refugee]] camp [[Lothal re-settlement camp 43|Tarkintown]] that, after the camp was destroyed by the [[Galactic Empire]], the smoke plume was visible from the farm.<ref name="The Siege of Lothal">''[[Star Wars Rebels: The Siege of Lothal]]''</ref>

